==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|sg=[[foul]] [[play]]|-}}

# Unfair, [[unethical]], or [[criminal]] behavior, especially of a malicious or violent nature.
#* '''1885:''' [[w:Robert Louis Stevenson|Robert Louis Stevenson]], ''[[w:The Strange Case of Dr. Jekyll & Mr. Hyde|The Strange Case of Dr. Jekyll & Mr. Hyde]]''
#*: "I think there's been '''fool play'''", said Poole, hoarsely
# Any violation of rules.

